msgid "Performance"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.rst:103
msgid ""
"Read a local project's name from `pyproject.toml` instead of building it "
"twice. (:issue:`2108`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.rst:104
msgid ""
"Start every pipx command 50 to 130 ms faster by importing only what it uses. "
"(:issue:`2113`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.rst:105
msgid ""
"Create the shared libraries 35 to 50% faster by skipping a redundant pip "
"run. (:issue:`2114`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.rst:106
msgid ""
"Start half as many helper processes per install by reusing what pipx knows. "
"(:issue:`2118`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.rst:107
msgid ""
"Skip a WMI query on Windows at startup by detecting the OS with "
"`sys.platform`. (:issue:`2125`)"
