#: ../../../changelog.rst:108
msgid ""
"Uninject orphaned dependencies in one pip call, reported on one line. "
"(:issue:`2126`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.rst:109
msgid ""
"Check only pipx-managed packages for updates, not every installed "
"dependency. (:issue:`2127`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.rst:110
msgid ""
"Start pipx commands up to 30 ms faster by loading more modules on first use. "
"(:issue:`2128`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.rst:111
msgid ""
"Start pipx 10 to 50 ms faster on Python 3.15 through lazy imports. "
"(:issue:`2129`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.rst:112
msgid ""
"Check shared pip by its files instead of starting Python on every command. "
"(:issue:`2131`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.rst:113
msgid ""
"Read a local wheel's package name from its metadata instead of a probe venv. "
"(:issue:`2134`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.rst:114
msgid ""
"Scan exposed app and man page dirs once per `list` and `uninstall-all`. "
"(:issue:`2138`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.rst:115
msgid ""
"Require filelock 4.2, whose lighter import speeds up most pipx commands. "
"(:issue:`2142`)"
